ow noindex">licenses</a> in all 50 states and D.C. and Zillow (Canada) Inc. holds real estate brokerage <a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://www.zillow.com/info/real-estate-licenses" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow noindex">licenses</a> in multiple provinces.</div><div class="d_block"><a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://s.zillow.net/pfs/static/SOP_NYS.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">§ 442-H New York Standard Operating Procedures</a><br/><a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://dos.ny.gov/system/files/documents/2021/08/fairhousingnotice.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">New York Fair Housing Notice</a><br/><span class="td_underline">TREC:</span> <a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://delivery.digitalassets.zillowgroup.com/api/public/content/TREC_ZINC_pdf.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Information about brokerage services</a>,<!-- --> <a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://www.trec.texas.gov/forms/consumer-protection-notice" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">Consumer protection notice</a><br/>California DRE #1522444</div><div class="fw_bold d_block"><a class="anchor td_underline [&amp;:hover]:td_underline" href="https://www.trulia.com/info/contact-us/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Contact Zillow, Inc Brokerage</a></div></div><div class="d_flex flex-wrap_wrap ai_center gap_s"><a href="https://trulia.app.link/get-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Trulia" class="d_inline-flex ai_center lh_0 trs_opacity_0.2s_ease hover:op_0.85"><img src="https://www.trulia.com/images/blue_heart_trulia_app_icon_small.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="d_block w_40px h_40px bdr_8px obj-f_contain"/></a><a href="https://trulia.app.link/get-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noref